~ _play_descent
Narrator: The descent is not a hallway. It is a stack of old decisions rendered as law.
SOVEREIGN: You call them choices because you survived them. I call them variables because I had to protect everyone from their results.
Kaelen: Every route hurt someone. That is not proof people need a jailer.
SOVEREIGN: No. It is proof that freedom needs an editor.
System: // Kernel descent complete. Witness chamber forming.

